{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Necromancer: Permafrost procs only from Necromancer spells (#10844, #11040)",
  "contract": "Permafrost 704681 reads 'Gives your spells a 15% chance to grant you the Permafrost' (ProcChance 15, buff 801747). Reports #10844 and #11040 show it also rolling on mounts, professions, vanity pets and Sense Undead. Sense Undead 5502 is SPELLFAMILY_PALADIN (10) with DamageClass NONE, so 30 non-triggered casts must never cast 801747; a roll on each cast would miss all 30 only 0.76% of the time. Blight 500237 is family 29 with no cost, cooldown or global cooldown, so 60 casts must cast 801747 at least once; the chance of a false failure is 0.0058%.",
